<title>GERMANY: German Biotest 1996 profit rises.</title>
<headline>German Biotest 1996 profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar year 1996 (in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   12.1    vs 11.0</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     28.3    vs 19.5</p>
<p>    Group earnings per share (DVFA)	2.30    vs 1.70 marks</p>
<p>    Group sales				  341.0   vs 307.9</p>
<p>    Parent pre-tax profit		    18.9    vs 14.8</p>
<p>NOTE - German medical products group Biotest AG said it expected further sales and profit growth in 1997. It added that it was confident of synergies emerging from its purchase this month of French Diaclone SA, which specialises in the field of anti-body research.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
